; The Spire's Foot: the base of the tower close to, its great door, the
; apple tree leaning on its shoulder, the rain barrel. Light from the low
; sun to the left: the tower's left face lit warm, its right in shadow,
; shadows falling right. Then, in layers: the apple (in the tree, on the
; grass), the open door, Ysolde (@actor), and copies of what stands in
; front of her (the trunk, the barrel, the open door's lamplight).
